#: scenario4:scenario4_15CB16D0_E549_433B_9F2B_A0AE54A1DD91
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 119435bb134a5ca81b279dc63f1e075830015f05f4edc0c9b432294e0eef9a13
#. default-sha256: 6820bb22c13103a7c39799db904d157791a1d9820b753bac2395849d5e8d6959
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_15CB16D0_E549_433B_9F2B_A0AE54A1DD91"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫On his way back from the washroom several days later, Michel heard muffled voices."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫彼女が倒れて数日、⟪k:1⟫手水から戻ろうとしたミシェルが聞いたのは、⟪k:2⟫不審な声でした。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_EA5D1A03_3268_4A54_8101_886DD8F3E0E0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e4d68d7eaff2c1c2e43e6432c00d5968d8a74aa537f833967fddd16360e38c41
#. default-sha256: 283a5509a650f8205d69bb315b6a6bfff9da1c054f4478a6e6a05f349b545c52
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_EA5D1A03_3268_4A54_8101_886DD8F3E0E0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫......e⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫......got it?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫.........ill⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫......im⟪k:8⟫"
"⟪k:9⟫............good..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……は、⟪k:1⟫……いいか、⟪k:2⟫………を、⟪k:3⟫……せば、⟪k:4⟫……もう……。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_6EB564AD_94E5_468B_B345_ED2F871A2E39
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0a9517b88202ea126070989db856166020995c9435ab33495a2b401195b75b5c
#. default-sha256: 9d300e0729e0aa9015af7bc90b5880d54190c08f1ce1832bc8333b53d65dc730
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_6EB564AD_94E5_468B_B345_ED2F871A2E39"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He was having trouble making out what they were saying, but he could tell it was several "
"men, and they were outside the front door."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫それはくぐもっていながらも、⟪k:1⟫複数であると分かりました。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫玄関の大扉の向こうから、"
"⟪k:4⟫男たちの声が聞こえてまいります。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_7EC4247B_E5E4_4739_B6F7_7877CE948467
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 411657210869fcf684be5fa064f9a6baedfc49dcc79c16249abc5aa54c76e57a
#. default-sha256: 3cec7175b6f7941cd7ae0dc2943226a7e420ad4dc60f6c519f3ad16229a0202c
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_7EC4247B_E5E4_4739_B6F7_7877CE948467"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The fact that he could hear them at all through the heavy door meant they were probably "
"shouting quite loudly."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫かすかなものでしたが、⟪k:1⟫扉を隔ててこうも聞こえるということは――向こう側では、⟪k:2⟫怒号が響"
"いていたのやもしれません。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_15A7E258_72FE_465C_88F0_C2CB7DEE21F5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 331d6edc5e3c3817a1fda71fd497ab405378b5bbc0bb8a92935207bdced76789
#. default-sha256: ebb8dbe630102fe29ffc8cfa496d48a45ac16b09ec227bb87d16f6d95a2eafa9
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_15A7E258_72FE_465C_88F0_C2CB7DEE21F5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_5CEEA977_CD91_4C02_B668_368F8D0B8781
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 81e11d6d97dfe5af2327380c7597e746b75e8582235a90dfdba64bad258376bb
#. default-sha256: ebf7a43ad5f19d51337054db1f33e95b8f7337a1d642f1a73005065852bb7271
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_5CEEA977_CD91_4C02_B668_368F8D0B8781"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫An indescribable sense of uneasiness came over him. ⟪k:1⟫Dread. ⟪k:2⟫He drew nearer to the "
"door and focused on the voices on the other side."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫彼の胸中には、⟪k:1⟫言いようのない不安が広がっていきました。⟪k:2⟫嫌な予感、⟪k:3⟫というもので"
"す。⟪k:4⟫ミシェルは扉に近付いて、⟪k:5⟫聞き耳をたてました。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_94A37FCB_0D02_4E7F_831E_711A98040308
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1d367d2c02cc18968ba2493c606e016d3756818336e7e6c63d891f314430b459
#. default-sha256: 57a12bc30a617c74942dd72d888aae9aac703fe51b755a7dcdc9d05218491de0
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_94A37FCB_0D02_4E7F_831E_711A98040308"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫They grew clearer—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫enough for him to make out what the men were saying."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫すると――いくらかはっきりと、⟪k:1⟫そう、⟪k:2⟫何を言っているのか分かる程度まで、⟪k:3⟫男たちの声"
"が聞こえたのです。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_DE196966_60D1_4F84_A73A_06CABADD72E2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9f831d45ac1c65a7e08d6d34b375eda576cba7b37b4c95500d33c7cdeb3f1d68
#. default-sha256: 354611e073772128c53f3f6432e26c5ee0a4cec5b0cb81d7e5cc152be35c38e8
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_DE196966_60D1_4F84_A73A_06CABADD72E2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Everything’s in place.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫We’re ready to kill this witch now."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫―――魔女を殺す準備は出来ているな。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_020BB8B6_BA4E_4354_A1E9_8CEC4E825D30
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 232dbfbf04c4da13bfc8d3761e4118f10f31076a65a25743113e1fe33c67c39c
#. default-sha256: 6946d0fd24feb21ef8d0a841efb2b5d280c65469f8a8ccb866963830f92b9b69
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_020BB8B6_BA4E_4354_A1E9_8CEC4E825D30"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫This is definitely the place.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫That half-dead bandit said she was in this mansion."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫ここで間違いがない……、⟪k:1⟫あの死にかけた盗賊が漏らしたのは、⟪k:2⟫この屋敷のことだった。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_F5E94AA9_A9AA_4E9A_A20B_D8B3B8954BB6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ed408201f1c82d846ac080f04a698b345ea5a6c6fdd5ba54eef3457c096acf61
#. default-sha256: 1bd970c1824c793d310d7ce0876f6fe46be23142f8b3257266f7599436aca093
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_F5E94AA9_A9AA_4E9A_A20B_D8B3B8954BB6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Listen well. No matter what we find in there, we kill it.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It could be a child for "
"all I care—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫that doesn’t change anything."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫いいか、⟪k:1⟫見つけ出したものは、⟪k:2⟫たとえそれが子供であろうとも殺すんだ。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_D8BD9768_36BB_40C7_BE0E_01A88DBA775F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ff72b76e8ac848b11870df28c4e88a2d5471247ba3b63b01595b74d908f8e601
#. default-sha256: 3a705f361f0daa0cee2c76ee976503176272eb619e33f06b17b0f743ef9031f5
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_D8BD9768_36BB_40C7_BE0E_01A88DBA775F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Kill the witch..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫魔女は殺せ……。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_E6DBC15F_E0F2_4941_B4B3_FB7674C65739
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b7a98799cac126e758d5e04d51be67d83ea801a58207357cb319f102cd034428
#. default-sha256: 685f50990f1e3c65588a2f8db685443a8c30722cefb199dc0588d74cd00aaddd
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_E6DBC15F_E0F2_4941_B4B3_FB7674C65739"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Kill the witch! Kill the witch! Kill the witch!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫魔女は殺せ！　⟪k:1⟫魔女は殺せ！　⟪k:2⟫魔女は殺せ！"

#: scenario4:scenario4_2CB8A8EE_8568_44A3_ADA7_4EB7FB5ED8F5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 26fd720f3e400fea2e9f26fe65239b592cc1acf564ec8f1816c8fabff9f88291
#. default-sha256: be4f01a4773be5dad76f8731bfdfead4f862faaaf32a54e485a9eeef2246279f
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_2CB8A8EE_8568_44A3_ADA7_4EB7FB5ED8F5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫—!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫―――ッ！！"

#: scenario4:scenario4_6E7CDC7B_C369_47C1_BA22_A4E17465AAA1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 421fb7bf92b95812df87673e5bd8e7eb86de8c290b9109eb52ec4dc65f182a74
#. default-sha256: d4aad8bd58bd1f7af7ca6a50e54ab95ed8d6eefa98c29f8a289e39d85289a615
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_6E7CDC7B_C369_47C1_BA22_A4E17465AAA1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫What he heard beyond the door was a group of men shouting for the death of the witch."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫聞こえてくるのは、⟪k:1⟫鬼気迫る声の数々。⟪k:2⟫そのどれもが、⟪k:3⟫「魔女を殺せ」と口に出す……。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_A690B82C_4F7D_4B0F_9AD2_462D3342E8CD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9191ae4f4bed2c3143d107fb944bf807bac85249109d4e378d1edcb296a3d0c4
#. default-sha256: 0689055eff3113745a07d673134effdd4ad70e43b37d8fb6c2f7bfa7265054c3
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_A690B82C_4F7D_4B0F_9AD2_462D3342E8CD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫In that moment, Michel regretted his decision to let the bandit go free and not watch over "
"him until the moment of his demise."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫そのような状況で、⟪k:1⟫ミシェルは悔いたのでしょう。⟪k:2⟫あの時、⟪k:3⟫無法者が死ぬところを見届"
"けなかったのを。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_3245971D_8FCA_4EC9_8C19_3F353B987522
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c3884a260fa3606cfb3e72ec79be37a81f65ac309c067d263e62cd4ad97b73ed
#. default-sha256: 16eced83a9fd906778aa69c994bac109e4003bfd7bf92cf8c5ee8f56cdb6fcbe
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_3245971D_8FCA_4EC9_8C19_3F353B987522"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He must have made his way down to the village in search of help, where he revealed what he "
"had found at the mansion."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫恐らく死にかけた無法者は、⟪k:1⟫助けを求めに村に下ったに違いありません。⟪k:2⟫そしてそこで、"
"⟪k:3⟫館の話をしたのでしょう……。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_F047AE0F_CCB8_4BDB_AC49_0FD8AD283747
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 44dd2d21e564af52cfa2ae3edd2a8c28b492d4fba8e4d2fd4e281472b1b437a9
#. default-sha256: 474c156669be8976972b51bed2d6f04c1bdf3e1782fca1bdf546701496fa1056
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_F047AE0F_CCB8_4BDB_AC49_0FD8AD283747"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Dammit!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……くそ……ッ！"

#: scenario4:scenario4_54F65A8D_97D4_464B_8D56_5B38582F256D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2a45fefa154a6f983f1fb82f5b33b501786b0415f4665aeafe8777be10bf885d
#. default-sha256: 4f043c85d940f4407a150f2a509b36e8a9fab664baa907501049cd2c036b4b60
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_54F65A8D_97D4_464B_8D56_5B38582F256D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But it was too late.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Regret would solve nothing."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫けれど――手遅れなのです。⟪k:1⟫何もかもが。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_51142D17_A574_4A28_9DD0_1458CF035845
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ccb08bc0105acef2bfacd55a836988ab8832e6792c5fe0bb38c90c80a5bf2f4d
#. default-sha256: 41c15ff696c3350c480c65db71ea9f4f379934e1970d6078c891b2313ff1d3dc
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_51142D17_A574_4A28_9DD0_1458CF035845"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He could neither stop the villagers from raiding the house, nor could he stop the White-"
"Haired Girl from dying to the effects of his curse."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫村の民たちが迫ってきてしまったことも――、⟪k:1⟫それから、⟪k:2⟫彼女が自分の呪いで死のうとしてい"
"ることも。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_181FDD0D_E253_466B_A870_811424899C19
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
